#               a diagonal gradient and a COLOR_MODE-keyed cache; i18n RU/EN —
#               tr(), --lang, the lang/ru/en menu command, TRIVORTEX_LANG/
#               LANG autodetect, translations of all 77 mode names; a
#               progress bar with a spinner, ETA and speed (auto-shown in
#               run_simulation! on a TTY at N≥500); a live HUD monitor
#               (CPU/RAM/load/uptime/N/engine): the menu footer and the st
#               command; the menu table of contents in book typography: an
#               80-column frame, Roman-numeral chapters with ranges, two
#               columns of items, ▶ on the last launched mode; /text mode
#               search; the ? command panel; CLI: --help, --lang.
#               Color backend: TTY detection via stdout isa TTY (previously
#               isinteractive() — a script in a terminal got ANSI16), the
#               ansi256 mode (a 6×6×6 cube), COLORTERM/truecolor detection
#               and a truecolor SGR-sequence fix (a space before "m" broke
#               the code).
#    2.1.0-jl — auto-run after include; the N ceiling and the Havelock
#               threshold are configurable (--max-bodies, --havelok,
#               0 = no limits); a body-matrix generator (7 types, scalar ×k
#               scaling up to infinity); the barnes_hut engine on a scene
#               goes through an O(N log N) quadtree; history-every for
#               large N; every config parameter is overridable (CLI + menu);
#               fixes: the sun_all_planets preset (N=9) now assembles,
#               frame_save returns a path (not bytes), an honest BH speed
#               measurement (a warm-up before @elapsed), EOF exit from
